      "body": "GeoIP.dat on my servers is dated 2017-12-02 (ie., very out-of-date). If I remove it and **plan reload**, I get\r\n```\r\n[14:43:05] [Plan Reload Thread/ERROR]: [Plan] Error: Something went wrong saving the downloaded GeoLite2 Geolocation database\r\n```\r\nI can create a MaxMind account. It looks like GeoLiteIP data (saved as GeoIP.dat) are sufficient for the API. Which file should be downloaded?\r\n- GeoLite2-ASN\r\n- GeoLite2-ASN-CSV\r\n- GeoLite2-City\r\n- GeoLite2-City-CSV\r\n- GeoLite2-Country\r\n- GeoLite2-Country-CSV\r\n\r\nPlease help with complete instructions for how to use the file.",
